msgid "followed plan"
msgstr "plan suivi"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/followedPlan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source prose plan followed at an attempt start. Its information object carries planText without requiring an executable logic:Plan, compiled prescription or fabricated prescription version."
msgstr "Plan en prose suivi au début d’une tentative. Son objet informationnel porte planText sans exiger de logic:Plan exécutable, de prescription compilée ou de version inventée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/followedPlan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
