msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nextAction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nextAction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/nextAction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
