msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/releaseReason|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:releaseReason \"source-value\" ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:releaseReason \"source-value\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GoalConditionOccurrenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Goal condition occurrence constraint"
msgstr "Contrainte d’occurrence de condition de but"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GoalConditionOccurrenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each linked condition occurrence retains its source prose, exact local key, zero-based ordinal and a configured verifier of the same goal with that exact key; no executable goal expression is manufactured."
msgstr "Chaque occurrence de condition liée conserve son texte source, sa clé locale exacte, son rang à partir de zéro et un vérificateur configuré du même but avec cette clé exacte ; aucune expression de but exécutable n’est inventée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GoalConditionOccurrenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the source-evidence obligation of hasSatisfactionCondition."
